<title>NORWAY: Nycomed operating result per division.</title>
<headline>Nycomed operating result per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nycomed ASA operating result per division for the nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>			    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Nycomed Imaging		 1,395    vs     1,785</p>
<p> Nycomed Pharma		    376    vs	 435</p>
<p> Research &amp; Development  minus 672    vs minus 670</p>
<p> Unallocated eliminations	 62    vs	  62</p>
